  "lines": {
    "S1": "People moving themselves guess truck size; we count instead.",
    "S2": "You film each room. Gemini Four Hydrogen lists every item with size, weight, and handling.",
    "S3": "The Gemini Decisions API settles what the footage leaves unclear, asking you only when unsure.",
    "S4": "You check the list: counts, what stays, and anything missed.",
    "S5": "A three D solver packs trucks, and a checker tests support, stacking, and balance.",
    "S6": "Gemini Four Neon reads the checker's result and changes the plan: two trucks become one, no rules broken.",
    "S6_alt": "Gemini Four Neon reads checker results and changes solver settings to raise the score.",
    "S7": "Across sixteen sets, mostly venue rooms, sixteen of ours broke no rules; the stock packer had three.",
    "S8": "Built today with Gemini. Try it on your phone."
